   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANO301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Visual development for digital design — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13439 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANO301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Visual development for digital design — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13439 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">ANO301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Visual development for digital design_Phát triển hình ảnh cho thiết kế kỹ thuật số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br>= 45h contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">ANC301 or ANC302</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Practice,discussion</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13439</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">ANO301</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Visual development for digital design_Phát triển hình ảnh cho thiết kế kỹ thuật số</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br>= 45h contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">ANC301 or ANC302</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Practice,discussion</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13439</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>Description:<br>- This course will arm students with the conceptual and technical knowledge needed to develop 2D game projects. There are a series of foundations for experimentation and exploration of video game design, story, character development, and winning gameplay before programming begins. The courses emphasize the self-reliance and personal expression of the gaming artist, and encourage you to take conceptual risks and develop new modes of expression and form through gaming. There will be also a series of tutorials to develop gameplay without coding.<br><br>Objective:<br>- Understand primary concepts of gaming, and an exploration of how these basic concepts affect the way gamers interact with our games.<br>- Understand what defines a “game” and the mechanics and rules behind different types of games.<br>- Examine how storytelling acts as a vital mechanism for driving video gameplay forward.<br>- Understand game story flows and the strategic elements of gameplay.<br>- Investigate key components of environment and level design.<br>- Create successful character designs that can be applied to video games<br>- Complete a 2d game project.<br>Teaching method:<br>Under lecturer’s instruction, through a series of instruction sessions, tutorials, work analysis and group exercises, students will be equipped with knowledge and skills to complete a game project.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>Description:<br>- This course will arm students with the conceptual and technical knowledge needed to develop 2D game projects. There are a series of foundations for experimentation and exploration of video game design, story, character development, and winning gameplay before programming begins. The courses emphasize the self-reliance and personal expression of the gaming artist, and encourage you to take conceptual risks and develop new modes of expression and form through gaming. There will be also a series of tutorials to develop gameplay without coding.<br><br>Objective:<br>- Understand primary concepts of gaming, and an exploration of how these basic concepts affect the way gamers interact with our games.<br>- Understand what defines a “game” and the mechanics and rules behind different types of games.<br>- Examine how storytelling acts as a vital mechanism for driving video gameplay forward.<br>- Understand game story flows and the strategic elements of gameplay.<br>- Investigate key components of environment and level design.<br>- Create successful character designs that can be applied to video games<br>- Complete a 2d game project.<br>Teaching method:<br>Under lecturer’s instruction, through a series of instruction sessions, tutorials, work analysis and group exercises, students will be equipped with knowledge and skills to complete a game project.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13439\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13439</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13439\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13439</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
